he last windo)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(w_runs occurrences of a chain are counted for each class, kept in an incremental index) is offered as one composite. groups: a user-defined action used on min_classes classes that share traits is offered a group (named trait bundle) of what they share. Accepting writes only user overlays; every proposal leaves a node of `node.kind` with links `node.link` to the messages it emerged from.","required":["setting","active","presets","command_shape","naming","requires_from","definition","sequences","groups","node"],"properties":{"setting":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"active":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"presets":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"object"}},"command_shape":{"type":"object","required":["max_tokens","min_lead_chars","element_within","lead_skip","not_leads","forbid_question_mark","verbs","statement"],"properties":{"max_tokens":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"existing_prefix_chars":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"P30: a lead verb that equals, matches by wildcard or shares this many leading characters (folded) with a phrase of an existing action names that action, so it is never offered as a new one. 0 turns the near match off (equal and wildcard matches stay)."},"min_lead_chars":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"element_within":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"lead_skip":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"not_leads":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"forbid_question_mark":{"type":"boolean"},"verbs":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"description":"P17: the lead of a command must be a verb from the list of the sentence's language (folded: lower case, no diacritics; PL imperative and infinitive, EN imperative). A language without a list accepts any list. A sentence that begins with anything else (\"First message of run 1\") is a statement, never a command, so it is not offered as a new action."},"verbs_extra":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":{"ty