sage: locally and free (preset), with a model where it is unsure, always with a model, or not at all."},"effect":{"pl":"Model w rozpoznawaniu = lepsze trafienia i dodatkowe wywołanie przy wiadomości.","en":"A model in recognition = better hits and an extra call per message."},"levels":["installation","person","turn"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"polecenia","flows":["input.route_intent"]}},{"key":"intent_routing_run","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"intent_routing","pointer":"/execution/active"},"description":"Whether a command from the chat waits for the user's yes (propose, preset), runs at once when its plan only reads and the rules ask for nothing (read_only), or runs at once (always). The rules and the x10 usage confirmation apply in every case.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Wykonanie polecenia z rozmowy","en":"Running a command from the chat"},"why":{"pl":"Czy polecenie czeka na Twoje „tak” (preset), rusza od razu, gdy tylko czyta, czy rusza zawsze.","en":"Whether a command waits for your yes (preset), runs at once when it only reads, or always runs at once."},"effect":{"pl":"Reguły i Bezpiecznik ×10 pytają niezależnie od tego pola.","en":"The rules and the ×10 fuse ask regardless of this field."},"levels":["person"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"polecenia","flows":["input.route_intent"]}},{"key":"intent_routing_on_reject","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"intent_routing","pointer":"/on_reject/active"},"description":"What a no to a proposal from the chat does with the sentence the proposal came from: offer (preset: the reply offers, in the same proposal block and by the words \"send as message\", to send the sentence to the model as an ordinary message), send_as_message (it is sent at once) or drop (it is not sent). Whatever is sent has exactly the request bytes of an ordinary message. Runtime profile intent_routing.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Po odrzuceniu pro)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(pozycji","en":"After a rejected proposal"},"why":{"pl":"Co dzieje się ze zdaniem, z którego powstała odrzucona propozycja: oferta wysłania jako wiadomość (preset), wysłanie od razu albo porzucenie.","en":"What happens to the sentence a rejected proposal came from: an offer to send it as a message (preset), sending at once, or dropping it."},"effect":{"pl":"Wysłane zdanie idzie do modelu dokładnie jak zwykła wiadomość.","en":"A sent sentence goes to the model exactly like an ordinary message."},"levels":["person"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"polecenia","flows":["input.route_intent"]}},{"key":"intent_routing_model","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Model used for routing when the method is model; empty = the default model.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Model rozpoznawania poleceń","en":"Command recognition model"},"why":{"pl":"Który model ocenia, czy wpis jest poleceniem, gdy metoda rozpoznawania używa modelu; pusty = model rozmowy.","en":"Which model judges whether an entry is a command when the recognition method uses a model; empty = the conversation model."},"effect":{"pl":"Tańszy model = tańsze rozpoznawanie; działa tylko wtedy, gdy rozpoznawanie używa modelu: „zawsze modelem” albo „modelem tam, gdzie aplikacja nie jest pewna”.","en":"A cheaper model = cheaper recognition; applies only when recognition uses a model: “always with a model” or “with a model where the app is unsure”."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"role","role":"intent.routing","flows":["input.route_intent","ports.show","roles.resolved"],"technical_only":true,"when_unset":{"pl":"model rozmowy","en":"the conversation model"}}},{"key":"extrapolation_preset","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"action_rules","pointer":"/extrapolation/active"},"description":"Preset of the chain proposals the engine makes when an element lacks what an action needs (off, standard or generous; presets are runtime/action_rules.pack). This is the user's level of a value that the scope chain resolves: a rule on a conversation or a project may set another one, and propose_chain / explain say which scope set the value. Default: the profile's active preset (standard).","human":{"label":{"pl":"Podpowiedzi łańcuchów działań","en":"Action chain suggestions"},"why":{"pl":"Jak śmiało aplikacja proponuje łańcuch kroków, gdy elementowi brakuje czegoś do działania: wcale, standardowo (preset) albo hojnie.","en":"How boldly the app proposes a chain of steps when an element lacks what an action needs: not at all, standard (preset) or generous."},"effect":{"pl":"Hojniej = więcej i dłuższych propozycji (z szacunkiem kosztu); rozmowa lub projekt mogą mieć własny poziom.","en":"More generous = more and longer proposals (with a cost estimate); a conversation or project may have its own level."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"polecenia","flows":["actions.propose_chain"]}},{"key":"extrapolation_bounds","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"The user's own thresholds of chain proposals: an object with any of max_length, max_cost, min_confidence, max_results (null = no bound); each member overrides the preset at the user's level and is itself overridden by a more specific scope. Default: none (the preset's bounds).","human":{"label":{"pl":"Własne granice podpowiedzi","en":"Your own suggestion bounds"},"why":{"pl":"Twoje progi dla łańcuchów: najdłuższy łańcuch, najwyższy koszt, najniższa pewność, liczba wyników; brak = bez granicy.","en":"Your thresholds for chains: longest chain, highest cost, lowest confidence, number of results; absent = no bound."},"effect":{"pl":"Każdy podany próg zastępuje ten z presetu; pozostałe zostają.","en":"Each threshold you give replaces the preset's; the others stay."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":")LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(polecenia","flows":["actions.propose_chain"],"when_unset":{"pl":"granice presetu","en":"the bounds of the preset"}}},{"key":"action_result_target","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"action_results","pointer":"/target/active"},"description":"Where the result of an action run goes: graph (preset: a form node linked to its source element and to the run), run_only (the result stays in the run document) or conversation_message (the text is also posted as a message of the conversation and linked in the graph). Runtime profile action_results. This is the user's level of a value that the scope chain resolves: a rule on a conversation or a project may set another one. Text above the profile's inline_max_bytes goes to the blob store whatever the target is. Default: graph.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Gdzie trafia wynik działania","en":"Where an action's result goes"},"why":{"pl":"Wynik działania: węzeł w grafie (preset), tylko w dokumencie przebiegu albo dodatkowo jako wiadomość rozmowy.","en":"The result of an action: a node in the graph (preset), the run document only, or additionally a message of the conversation."},"effect":{"pl":"Zmienia tylko, gdzie wynik widać; przebieg zawsze go ma.","en":"Changes only where the result is seen; the run always keeps it."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"polecenia","flows":["actions.run"]}},{"key":"emergent_actions","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"intent_routing","pointer":"/emergent/active"},"description":"Whether the catalogue of actions grows from your conversations (R55): propose (preset: a command no action understands, a sequence you keep repeating, or an action used on several classes is offered as a new action or group, never made silently) or off. Accepting writes only your own overlays (profiles/actions.pack, profiles/intent_routing.pack, profiles/graph_entry.pack). Runtime profile intent_routing (emergent). Default: propose.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Nowe działania z rozmów","en":"New actions from conversations"},"why":{"pl":"Czy aplikacja proponuje nowe działania, gdy powtarzasz sekwencję albo wydajesz polecenie, którego żadne działanie nie rozumie (preset: proponuje, nigdy po cichu).","en":"Whether the app proposes new actions when you repeat a sequence or give a command no action understands (preset: it proposes, never silently)."},"effect":{"pl":"Wyłączone: katalog działań rośnie tylko, gdy sam je zdefiniujesz.","en":"Off: the catalogue of actions grows only when you define them yourself."},"levels":["person"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"polecenia","flows":["input.route_intent","actions.define"]}},{"key":"tool_loop_policy","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"tool_loop","pointer":"/policy"},"description":"What the agent (the tool loop of use_model) may do on its own: a preset of the runtime profile tool_loop - local_reversible (preset: local, reversible actions run, everything else is proposed and waits for you), read_only, confirm_all (every call is a proposal) or apply_all (every call runs; the rules of the interpreter, the x10 guard and the spending limits still apply) - or a policy of your own as an object {id?, rules: [{when?: {effects, actions, prefixes}, mode: run|propose|deny}]}. Default: local_reversible.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Co agent może sam","en":"What the agent may do alone"},"why":{"pl":"Które wywołania narzędzi agent wykonuje bez pytania: lokalne i odwracalne (preset), tylko odczyt, każde pyta, każde wykonuje — albo Twoja własna polityka.","en":"Which tool calls the agent runs without asking: local and reversible (preset), read only, every one asks, every one runs — or your own policy."},"effect":{"pl":"„Wykonuj wszystko” nadal podlega regułom, Bezpiecznikowi ×10 i limitom wydatków.","en":"“Run everything” still obeys the rules, the ×1)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(0 fuse and the spending limits."},"levels":["installation","person","turn"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"agent","flows":["agent.run"]}},{"key":"tool_loop_max_steps","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"integer","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"tool_loop","pointer":"/max_steps"},"description":"How many model turns one agent loop may take; 0 = no limit. Runtime profile tool_loop (max_steps). Default: 8.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Kroki jednej pracy agenta","en":"Steps of one agent job"},"why":{"pl":"Ile tur modelu ma jedna praca agenta; 0 = bez limitu.","en":"How many model turns one agent job may take; 0 = no limit."},"effect":{"pl":"Więcej kroków = dłuższa i droższa praca; po limicie agent zatrzymuje się i pokazuje, co zrobił.","en":"More steps = a longer and dearer job; at the limit the agent stops and shows what it did."},"levels":["installation","person","turn"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"agent","flows":["agent.run"]}},{"key":"tool_loop_on_proposal","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"tool_loop","pointer":"/on_proposal"},"description":"What the agent does when a call it made became a proposal that waits for you: stop (preset: the loop ends and shows the proposals) or continue (the model is told the call was not executed and goes on). Default: stop.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Agent przy propozycji","en":"Agent at a proposal"},"why":{"pl":"Gdy wywołanie agenta czeka na Twoje „tak”: praca kończy się i pokazuje propozycje (preset) albo idzie dalej z informacją dla modelu.","en":"When an agent call waits for your yes: the job ends and shows the proposals (preset) or goes on with a note to the model."},"effect":{"pl":"„Dalej” = model pracuje, nie czekając na Twoją decyzję o tym kroku.","en":"“Go on” = the model keeps working without waiting for your decision on that step."},"levels":["installation","person","turn"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"agent","flows":["agent.run"]}},{"key":"tool_loop_result_max_chars","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"integer","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"tool_loop","pointer":"/result_max_chars"},"description":"A tool result longer than this many characters is cut when it is handed back to the model (the run keeps all of it); 0 = no cut. Runtime profile tool_loop (result_max_chars). Default: 20000.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Ucięcie wyniku narzędzia dla modelu","en":"Tool result cut for the model"},"why":{"pl":"Dłuższy wynik narzędzia jest ucinany, zanim model go dostanie (przebieg ma całość); 0 = bez cięcia.","en":"A longer tool result is cut before the model gets it (the run keeps all of it); 0 = no cut."},"effect":{"pl":"Mniejsza wartość = tańsze kroki, ale model widzi mniej.","en":"A smaller value = cheaper steps, but the model sees less."},"levels":["installation","person","turn"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"agent","flows":["agent.run"]}},{"key":"chat_history_command_traffic","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"How the exchange of a chat command (what you typed as a command, the proposal, your answer to it) enters the history the chat model reads: skip_exchange (preset: left out, an action's result stays as context), skip_all (results left out too) or include (everything is sent). Default: skip_exchange.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Polecenia w historii dla modelu","en":"Commands in the history for the model"},"why":{"pl":"Czy wymiana wokół polecenia (Twoje polecenie, propozycja, Twoja odpowiedź) trafia do historii, którą czyta model: pomijana (preset), pomijana razem z wynikami albo w całości.","en":"Whether the exchange around a command (your command, the proposal, your answer) enters the history the model reads: skipped (preset), skipped with the results, or all of it."},"effect":{"pl":"Pominięcie = krótsze żądania; model nie widzi, co ustalaliście przy poleceniach.","en":"Skipping = shorter requests; the model does not see what you settled around commands."})LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(,"levels":["person"],"group":"rozmowa","subgroup":"polecenia","flows":["chat.send"],"when_unset":{"pl":"wymiana jest pomijana, wynik działania zostaje","en":"the exchange is left out, the result of an action stays"}}},{"key":"model_registry_autorefresh","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"action_run","pointer":"/estimate/registry_refresh/active"},"description":"Whether an estimate may fetch the provider's public model list when it needs a price and the model registry (models.json) is empty, which it is on a fresh data directory until the list is refreshed: on_demand (preset: the list is fetched once, no user data is sent; if the fetch fails the price stays unknown with the reason, and the next automatic attempt waits the profile's retry_after_seconds) or off (the registry is filled only by refreshing the model list yourself; an estimate without a price says so). Runtime profile action_run (estimate.registry_refresh). A name that is not a preset means on_demand. Default: on_demand.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Lista modeli pobierana sama","en":"Model list fetched by itself"},"why":{"pl":"Czy szacunek kosztu może raz pobrać publiczną listę modeli dostawcy, gdy rejestr jest pusty; żadne Twoje dane nie są wysyłane.","en":"Whether a cost estimate may fetch the provider's public model list once when the registry is empty; none of your data is sent."},"effect":{"pl":"Wyłączone: ceny są znane dopiero po ręcznym odświeżeniu listy, a szacunek bez ceny mówi to wprost.","en":"Off: prices are known only after you refresh the list yourself, and an estimate without a price says so."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"dostawca","flows":["actions.preview","models.refresh"]}},{"key":"image_model","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Model that paints images for the action depict (served by an openai_images provider, see image_provider). Empty = the action asks for one. Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Model obrazów","en":"Image model"},"why":{"pl":"Który model maluje obrazy dla działania „depict”; pusty = depict nie startuje i mówi, że brakuje modelu (nic nie jest płatne).","en":"Which model paints images for the action “depict”; empty = depict does not start and says the model is missing (nothing is paid)."},"effect":{"pl":"Działa przy następnym obrazie; potrzebuje dostawcy z pola Dostawca obrazów.","en":"Applies to the next image; needs the provider from the Image provider field."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"role","role":"image.generate","flows":["depict","ports.show","roles.resolved"],"technical_only":true,"when_unset":{"pl":"działanie pyta o model","en":"the action asks which model"}}},{"key":"image_provider","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Id of the provider manifest (config provider_manifests, adapter openai_images) that serves image_model. Empty = the action asks for one. Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Dostawca obrazów","en":"Image provider"},"why":{"pl":"Który z Twoich dodanych dostawców obsługuje model obrazów.","en":"Which of your added providers serves the image model."},"effect":{"pl":"Bez niego działanie „depict” pyta, dokąd wysłać.","en":"Without it the action “depict” asks where to send."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"role","role":"image.generate","flows":["depict","ports.show","roles.resolved"],"technical_only":true,"when_unset":{"pl":"działanie pyta o dostawcę","en":"the action asks which provider"}}},{"key":"speech_model","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Model that speaks for the action narrate (needs a provider whose adapter produces audio, see speech_provider). Empty = narrate returns the narration text only. Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Model mowy","en":"Speech model"},"why":{"pl":"Który model czyta na głos dla działania „narrate”; pusty = tylk)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(o tekst narracji.","en":"Which model speaks for the action “narrate”; empty = the narration text only."},"effect":{"pl":"Działa przy następnej narracji; potrzebuje dostawcy z pola Dostawca mowy.","en":"Applies to the next narration; needs the provider from the Speech provider field."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"role","role":"speech.synthesize","flows":["narrate","ports.show","roles.resolved"],"technical_only":true,"when_unset":{"pl":"tylko tekst narracji, bez dźwięku","en":"only the narration text, no audio"}}},{"key":"speech_provider","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Id of the provider manifest that serves speech_model. Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Dostawca mowy","en":"Speech provider"},"why":{"pl":"Który z Twoich dodanych dostawców obsługuje model mowy.","en":"Which of your added providers serves the speech model."},"effect":{"pl":"Bez niego działanie „narrate” zwraca tylko tekst.","en":"Without it the action “narrate” returns text only."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"role","role":"speech.synthesize","flows":["narrate","ports.show","roles.resolved"],"technical_only":true,"when_unset":{"pl":"brak dostawcy mowy","en":"no speech provider"}}},{"key":"guardian_method","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"guardian","pointer":"/method/active"},"description":"How the context guardian recognises signals in your messages (corrections, clarifications): heuristic (preset: word lists and structure, local and free), model (one guarded model call per message that no existing annotation already describes), hybrid (the local reading first, the model only where it found nothing) or off. The guardian is a secretary: it builds a representation of the conversation beside the raw messages and never changes them. Runtime profile guardian (method). Default: heuristic.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Jak Sekretarz czyta sygnały","en":"How the Secretary reads signals"},"why":{"pl":"Jak sekretarz rozmowy rozpoznaje poprawki i doprecyzowania: lokalnie (preset), modelem, najpierw lokalnie i modelem tam, gdzie nic nie znalazł, albo wcale.","en":"How the conversation's secretary recognises corrections and clarifications: locally (preset), with a model, locally first and the model where it found nothing, or not at all."},"effect":{"pl":"Model = dokładniej i płatnie (jedno chronione wywołanie na wiadomość bez adnotacji); Sekretarz nigdy nie zmienia Twoich wiadomości.","en":"A model = more accurate and paid (one guarded call per message without annotations); the Secretary never changes your messages."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"straznik","flows":["guardian.observe","guardian.annotate","semantic.analyse","semantic.batch","batch.chat"]}},{"key":"guardian_promotion","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"guardian","pointer":"/promotion/active"},"description":"What the guardian does when a hypothesis about you gathers enough weight: ask (ask at the first occurrence), propose (preset: propose a rule with its evidence at the threshold) or apply (write the rule at the higher threshold and say so; always reversible). The thresholds, the escalation curve and the weights are data in the runtime profile guardian. Default: propose.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Gdy Sekretarz jest pewny","en":"When the Secretary is sure"},"why":{"pl":"Co Sekretarz robi, gdy hipoteza o Tobie zbierze dość wagi: pyta od razu, proponuje regułę z dowodami (preset) albo zapisuje ją sam i mówi o tym.","en":"What the Secretary does when a hypothesis about you gathers enough weight: asks at once, proposes a rule with its evidence (preset), or writes it itself and says so."},"effect":{"pl":"„Zapisuje sam” = reguły powstają bez pytania; zawsze odwracalne (Ty › Reguły).","en":"“Writes itself” = rules appear without asking; always reversible (You › Rules)."},"levels":["p)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(erson"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"straznik","flows":["guardian.promote"]}},{"key":"guardian_model","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Model used by the guardian when its method asks one (reading, naming, matching). The model of the conversation is never inherited (owner decision 2026-10-15): it is used only if you set this by hand. Resolution is a policy in the runtime profile guardian (models.policies.guardian, overlay-able): this setting; else the ports role guardian (preset: the same choice as analysis.fast, i.e. semantic_model); else analysis.fast; else NO model - the guardian then reads with word lists only and says so (status, proposals). A policy step relative_to (one tier cheaper than another model, tiers from models.tiers) is available but never preset. The call goes through use_model and the usage guards (x10, spending limits). Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Model Sekretarza","en":"Secretary model"},"why":{"pl":"Który model pomaga Sekretarzowi czytać, nazywać i łączyć sygnały, gdy jego metoda tego wymaga; model rozmowy nigdy nie jest dziedziczony.","en":"Which model helps the Secretary read, name and join signals when its method asks for one; the conversation model is never inherited."},"effect":{"pl":"Pusty: Sekretarz bierze model z roli Sekretarz, która wskazuje pole „Model analizy w tle” (semantic_model). Rozmowa lub projekt mogą wskazać inny: to jedyne pole modelu, które Sekretarz czyta dla rozmowy.","en":"Empty: the Secretary takes the model of the role Secretary, which points at the field “Background analysis model” (semantic_model). A conversation or project may name another: this is the only model field the Secretary reads per conversation."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"role","role":"guardian","flows":["guardian.observe","guardian.annotate","guardian.status","guardian.model_read","ports.show","roles.resolved"],"technical_only":true,"when_unset":{"pl":"rola Strażnik, potem rola Analiza w tle, potem bez modelu (tylko listy słów)","en":"the Guardian role, else the background analysis role, else no model (word lists only)"}}},{"key":"guardian_levels","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Your own definition of the lossy levels of the guardian's representation, merged over the profile guardian (levels.defs): {L1: {drop_categories: [filler, repetition, restart]}, L2: {drop_categories: [digression, joke]}, ...}; a level you name that the profile does not know is added. Categories and thresholds are yours to choose; the original text is never touched and every drop records its category and span. Default: the profile.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Poziomy odchudzania rozmowy","en":"Conversation slimming levels"},"why":{"pl":"Twoja definicja, co znika na poziomie L1 (wypełniacze, powtórzenia…) i L2 w reprezentacji rozmowy wysyłanej modelowi.","en":"Your definition of what drops at level L1 (fillers, repetitions…) and L2 in the representation of the conversation sent to the model."},"effect":{"pl":"Działa od następnego żądania, gdy rozmowa idzie do modelu bez wypełniaczy, odchudzona albo z instrukcją Sekretarza (pole „Co model dostaje z rozmowy”).","en":"Applies from the next request when the conversation goes to the model without fillers, slimmed or with the Secretary's instruction (field “What the model gets of the conversation”)."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"straznik","flows":["chat.send","guardian.compile"],"when_unset":{"pl":"poziomy z profilu strażnika","en":"the levels of the guardian profile"}}},{"key":"semantic_segments","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"guardian","pointer":"/annotations/analyzer/active"},"description":"Whether the semantic analyzer's one prompt also returns the segment categories of a message (correction, preference, exception, digression, jo)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(ke, instruction ...) and its topic thread, written to the shared annotation layer: auto (preset: when something reads them - a guardian that uses a model, the lean representation, the thread filter), on or off (the classic prompt: entities, topics, relations). One call per message either way. Runtime profile guardian (annotations.analyzer). Default: auto. The flow follows the class of the analysis model (models.flows, calibration): a frontier-class model gets one call for everything, a cheap one the classic call and one narrow question for the segments.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Kategorie fragmentów w analizie","en":"Segment categories in the analysis"},"why":{"pl":"Czy analiza w tle zapisuje też rodzaj każdego fragmentu wiadomości (poprawka, preferencja, żart, polecenie…) i wątek tematu: gdy coś z tego korzysta (preset), zawsze albo nigdy.","en":"Whether the background analysis also records the kind of each message segment (correction, preference, joke, instruction…) and its topic thread: when something uses them (preset), always, or never."},"effect":{"pl":"Jedno wywołanie na wiadomość tak czy inaczej; bez kategorii filtr wątków i tryby odchudzone nie mają na czym pracować. Gdy analiza nie czyta fragmentów (nigdy, albo preset, gdy nic z nich nie korzysta), Sekretarz (metoda model albo hybryda) nie czeka na nią i czyta wiadomość własnym modelem — to płatne wywołanie.","en":"One call per message either way; without categories the thread filter and the slimmed modes have nothing to work on. When the analysis reads no segments (never, or the preset when nothing uses them), the Secretary (method model or hybrid) does not wait for it and reads the message with its own model — a paid call."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"analiza","flows":["semantic.analyse","semantic.batch","batch.chat","guardian.observe"]}},{"key":"chat_thread_filter","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"guardian","pointer":"/representation/thread_filter/active"},"description":"Whether the context selector leaves out of a request the messages the analyzer put in another topic thread than the one you are in: off (preset: every thread is sent) or current. The messages stay in the conversation; only the request is lighter. Runtime profile guardian (representation.thread_filter). Default: off.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Filtr wątków w żądaniu","en":"Thread filter in the request"},"why":{"pl":"Czy do modelu idą wiadomości z innych wątków tematu niż ten, w którym jesteś: wszystkie (preset) albo tylko bieżący.","en":"Whether messages from other topic threads than the one you are in go to the model: all (preset) or the current one only."},"effect":{"pl":"Tylko bieżący = lżejsze żądanie; wiadomości zostają w rozmowie.","en":"Current only = a lighter request; the messages stay in the conversation."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation"],"group":"rozmowa","flows":["chat.send","semantic.analyse","semantic.batch","batch.chat","guardian.observe"]}},{"key":"guardian_match_method","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"guardian","pointer":"/matching/active"},"description":"How the guardian recognises that several corrections are the same thing: overlap (preset: shared words and concepts, local and free), embedding (then the embedding tier of the search engine when available), model (then one guarded model question per candidate) or user (only what you declare, guardian merge). A wrong join is separated again with guardian unmerge, or by answering no to its proposal. Runtime profile guardian (matching). Default: overlap.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Jak Sekretarz łączy poprawki","en":"How the Secretary joins corrections"},"why":{"pl":"Jak Sekretarz poznaje, że kilka poprawek to to samo: wspólne słowa (preset), osadzenia, pytanie do modelu albo tylko to, co sam wskażesz.","en":"How the Secretary tells that several corrections are )LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(the same thing: shared words (preset), embeddings, a question to a model, or only what you point out."},"effect":{"pl":"Błędne połączenie rozdzielasz poleceniem „unmerge” albo odpowiedzią „nie” na propozycję.","en":"A wrong join is separated with “unmerge” or by answering no to its proposal."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"straznik","flows":["guardian.observe","guardian.annotate"]}},{"key":"guardian_person_rules","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"guardian","pointer":"/privacy/visibility/active"},"description":"Whether the rules the guardian keeps about you (scope person or wider) go with a request: send (preset) or off. Resolved in the scope chain (R47): a rule of one conversation can set it to off there. Only the normalized text of a rule is sent, never the quotes it was heard in. Runtime profile guardian (privacy.visibility). Default: send.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Reguły o Tobie w żądaniu","en":"Rules about you in a request"},"why":{"pl":"Czy reguły, które Sekretarz pamięta o Tobie, idą z każdym żądaniem (preset) czy nie; jedna rozmowa może to wyłączyć u siebie.","en":"Whether the rules the Secretary keeps about you go with every request (preset) or not; one conversation may switch it off for itself."},"effect":{"pl":"Wysyłany jest tylko tekst reguły, nigdy cytaty, z których powstała.","en":"Only the rule's text is sent, never the quotes it was heard in."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation"],"group":"ty","subgroup":"reguly","flows":["chat.send"]}},{"key":"chat_representation","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"guardian","pointer":"/representation/active"},"description":"What the context selector sends of a conversation: raw (preset: the messages as they are, request bytes unchanged), denoised (your messages at level L1, without fillers, repetitions and restarts), lean (level L2), guardian (L1 and a run of clarifications replaced by one compiled instruction) or mixed (the raw messages followed by the compiled instruction); or a preset of your own in the profile guardian (representation.presets). A value that the scope chain resolves: accepting a proposal of the guardian sets guardian for that conversation as a rule you can switch off. The compatibility mode (system prompt and raw conversation only) is unaffected. Default: raw.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Co model dostaje z rozmowy","en":"What the model gets of the conversation"},"why":{"pl":"Wiadomości jak są (preset), bez wypełniaczy (L1), odchudzone (L2), z instrukcją skompilowaną przez Sekretarza albo jedno i drugie.","en":"The messages as they are (preset), without fillers (L1), slimmed (L2), with the instruction the Secretary compiled, or both."},"effect":{"pl":"Odchudzone = tańsze żądanie, mniej dosłownie; przyjęcie propozycji Sekretarza ustawia dla tej rozmowy tryb „z instrukcją Sekretarza” jako regułę, którą możesz wyłączyć.","en":"Slimmed = a cheaper request, less literal; accepting a Secretary proposal sets the mode “with the Secretary's instruction” for that conversation as a rule you can switch off."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation"],"group":"rozmowa","flows":["chat.send","guardian.compile","semantic.analyse","semantic.batch","batch.chat","guardian.observe"]}},{"key":"chat_flow","scope":"config","group":"context","section":"Kontekst","subsection":"Przepływ wejścia i wyjścia","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Which flow the request goes through: how the context the selector chose (from the graph, by task, settings, representation) is rendered for the model and in which form the answer is asked for and taken back. A flow is data in the profile guardian (context_io.flows: renderer + output); shipped: plain (preset: ordinary chat turns in, plain text out, request bytes unchanged), graph_out (chat turns in, a graph reply out: loom.graph_reply/2 forced through a)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE( structured response format, prompt-only and validated for a model that cannot), graph_in (the selection as a graph packet in), graph_io (both). Empty: the flow of the model's class (context_io.class_flows), never the model of the conversation as such. A value that the scope chain resolves: \"w tej rozmowie ustaw chat_flow na graph_io\". A graph reply is rendered to the same text for you and its nodes and links are embedded in the graph with provenance to the message; an invalid reply is shown as raw text with a note. Graph replies are not streamed. Default: the flow of the class (all plain).","human":{"label":{"pl":"Przepływ żądania","en":"Request flow"},"why":{"pl":"W jakiej formie kontekst idzie do modelu i w jakiej wraca odpowiedź: zwykły czat (preset), graf w odpowiedzi, graf na wejściu albo oba.","en":"In which form the context goes to the model and the reply comes back: plain chat (preset), a graph in the reply, a graph on the way in, or both."},"effect":{"pl":"Z grafem w odpowiedzi model odpowiada w ustalonej strukturze, sprawdzanej przed pokazaniem; model, który nie umie, dostaje tylko prompt.","en":"With a graph in the reply the model answers in a fixed structure, checked before it is shown; a model that cannot gets a prompt only."},"levels":["installation","person","project","conversation","turn"],"group":"rozmowa","flows":["chat.send"],"when_unset":{"pl":"przepływ klasy modelu","en":"the flow of the model's class"}}},{"key":"environments_auto_sync","scope":"config","group":"loom","type":"boolean","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"graph_entry","pointer":"/environments/settings/auto_sync/value"},"description":"Before answering a question about environments (what can I do on my phone, in this directory), bring the environment, capability and access nodes of the graph up to date from their sources. Off: answer from the nodes as they are (environments.sync does it on request). Runtime profile graph_entry (environments.settings). Default: true.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Odświeżanie środowisk przed odpowiedzią","en":"Environment refresh before an answer"},"why":{"pl":"Zanim aplikacja odpowie, co może na tym urządzeniu lub w folderze, odświeża w grafie węzły środowisk i uprawnień (preset: tak).","en":"Before the app answers what it can do on this device or in a folder, it refreshes the environment and access nodes of the graph (preset: yes)."},"effect":{"pl":"Wyłączone: odpowiada z tego, co graf już ma, dopóki sam nie odświeżysz środowisk.","en":"Off: it answers from what the graph already holds until you refresh the environments yourself."},"levels":["person"],"group":"prywatnosc","subgroup":"urzadzenie","flows":["environments.can_do","environments.sync"]}},{"key":"environments_probe_paths","scope":"config","group":"loom","type":"boolean","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"graph_entry","pointer":"/environments/settings/probe_paths/value"},"description":"A question about a directory asks the operating system about it (exists, readable, writable); nothing in it is read. Off: only what the graph already holds. Runtime profile graph_entry (environments.settings). Default: true.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Pytanie systemu o folder","en":"Asking the system about a folder"},"why":{"pl":"Pytanie o folder sprawdza w systemie, czy istnieje i czy wolno go czytać lub pisać; nic w środku nie jest czytane.","en":"A question about a folder asks the system whether it exists and may be read or written; nothing inside is read."},"effect":{"pl":"Wyłączone: tylko to, co graf już wie.","en":"Off: only what the graph already knows."},"levels":["person"],"group":"prywatnosc","subgroup":"urzadzenie","flows":["environments.can_do"]}},{"key":"tool_sources","scope":"config","group":"loom","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Your tool sources: external servers whose tools become actions of the catalogue, id -> {kind (mcp), transport (stdio | http), command + args (stdio) or url (http), access: {secret: <key name in )LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(the secrets vault>, header?, scheme?} (a reference, never the key itself), env: {NAME: {secret: <key name>}}, label?, enabled?, effects?: {flag: value} for every tool of the source, tools?: {<tool>: {effects?: {...}, hidden?: bool}}}. Nothing is contacted or sent until you add a source and ask for it to be listed (tool_source.sync); the tools are written to your overlay profiles/actions.pack, each marked with unknown effects so that the rules ask before every run (relax with tool_source.trust). Runtime profile tool_sources. Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Źródła narzędzi","en":"Tool sources"},"why":{"pl":"Zewnętrzne serwery (MCP), których narzędzia stają się działaniami katalogu; każde z zaufaniem i dostępem, które ustalasz.","en":"External servers (MCP) whose tools become actions of the catalogue; each with the trust and access you set."},"effect":{"pl":"Dodane źródło pojawia się w katalogu po synchronizacji; usunięte znika razem ze swoimi działaniami.","en":"An added source appears in the catalogue after a sync; a removed one disappears with its actions."},"levels":["person"],"group":"prywatnosc","subgroup":"dane","flows":["tool_source.add","tool_source.sync","tool_source.trust"],"when_unset":{"pl":"brak źródeł narzędzi","en":"no tool source"}}},{"key":"context_execution","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Execution options of context plans (stored by the context engine).","human":{"label":{"pl":"Opcje wykonania planu kontekstu","en":"Context plan execution options"},"why":{"pl":"Jak aplikacja składa kontekst żądania: czy używa jednego wspólnego planu (pamięć, historia, graf, wiedza), jakim modelem mierzy podobieństwo znaczeń i w jakim trybie model odpowiada grafem.","en":"How the app assembles the context of a request: whether it uses one combined plan (memory, history, graph, knowledge), which model measures similarity of meaning, and in which mode the model replies with a graph."},"effect":{"pl":"Zmiana dotyczy następnych żądań; pusty obiekt = presety silnika.","en":"A change applies to the next requests; an empty object = the engine's presets."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"wybor","flows":["chat.send","goal.typing"],"when_unset":{"pl":"własne opcje silnika kontekstu","en":"the context engine's own options"}}},{"key":"chat_reasoning","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Overrides of the reasoning request parameters per model family.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Rozumowanie modelu","en":"Model reasoning"},"why":{"pl":"Ile „myślenia” prosisz od modelu i jak zgłaszać to poszczególnym rodzinom modeli.","en":"How much “thinking” you ask of the model and how to request it from each model family."},"effect":{"pl":"Więcej rozumowania = wolniej i drożej, często dokładniej; rodzina bez wpisu dostaje preset. Jedno żądanie może zmienić tylko poziom rozumowania, nie sposób zgłaszania.","en":"More reasoning = slower and dearer, often more accurate; a family without an entry gets the preset. A single request can change only the reasoning level, not how it is reported."},"levels":["person","turn"],"group":"rozmowa","flows":["chat.send"],"when_unset":{"pl":"profil rozumowania jak wbudowany","en":"the reasoning profile as shipped"}}},{"key":"analysis_prompt_overrides","scope":"config","group":"semantic","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Per-analysis prompt text overrides.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Własne teksty promptów analizy","en":"Your own analysis prompt texts"},"why":{"pl":"Twoje wersje promptów dla propozycji wiedzy (budowanie wiedzy z modelem) i dla przejrzanych analiz, podmienione za wbudowane; analiza wiadomości w tle ich nie czyta.","en":"Your versions of the prompts of knowledge proposals (building knowledge with a model) and of reviewed analyses, used instead of the built-in ones; the background analysis of messages does not read them."},"effect":{"pl":"Działa przy następnej propozycji wied)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(zy albo następnym uruchomieniu przejrzanej analizy.","en":"Applies to the next knowledge proposal or the next run of a reviewed analysis."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"analiza","flows":["knowledge.propose_semantics","analysis.run"],"when_unset":{"pl":"wbudowane prompty","en":"the shipped prompts"}}},{"key":"analysis_prompt_dir","scope":"config","group":"semantic","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Directory with analysis prompt files overriding the built-in ones.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Folder z promptami analizy","en":"Folder with analysis prompts"},"why":{"pl":"Folder z plikami promptów, które zastępują wbudowane w propozycjach wiedzy i w przejrzanych analizach; analiza wiadomości w tle go nie czyta.","en":"A folder of prompt files that replace the built-in ones in knowledge proposals and reviewed analyses; the background analysis of messages does not read it."},"effect":{"pl":"Plik o nazwie promptu w tym folderze wygrywa z wbudowanym.","en":"A file named after a prompt in this folder wins over the builtin one."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"analiza","flows":["knowledge.propose_semantics","analysis.run"],"when_unset":{"pl":"folder prompts w katalogu danych","en":"the prompts folder of the data directory"}}},{"key":"loom_semantic_usage_policy_required","scope":"config","group":"usage","type":"boolean","has_default":false,"description":"Require a usage-policy admission before semantic LLM calls.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Dopuszczenie kosztów przed analizą","en":"Cost admission before analysis"},"why":{"pl":"Czy każde wywołanie modelu w propozycjach wiedzy (budowanie wiedzy z modelem) musi najpierw przejść przez politykę zużycia.","en":"Whether every model call of knowledge proposals (building knowledge with a model) must first pass the usage policy."},"effect":{"pl":"Włączone: propozycja bez dopuszczenia czeka, zamiast wydawać.","en":"On: a proposal without admission waits instead of spending."},"levels":["person"],"group":"koszty","subgroup":"limity","flows":["knowledge.propose_semantics"],"when_unset":{"pl":"bez dopuszczenia przed analizą","en":"no admission asked before the analysis"}}},{"key":"github_repo","scope":"config","group":"sync","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"owner/name of the repository used by GitHub sync.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Repozytorium GitHub","en":"GitHub repository"},"why":{"pl":"Które repozytorium (właściciel/nazwa) synchronizuje Twoje dane w obie strony.","en":"Which repository (owner/name) syncs your data both ways."},"effect":{"pl":"Synchronizacja wysyła dane do tego repozytorium; bez tokena nic nie wychodzi.","en":"Sync sends data to this repository; without a token nothing leaves."},"levels":["person"],"group":"prywatnosc","subgroup":"synchronizacja","flows":["github.sync"],"when_unset":{"pl":"synchronizacja GitHub pyta o repozytorium","en":"GitHub sync asks which repository"}}},{"key":"context_goal_cues","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Overrides of the goal cue words used by context goal detection.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Słowa-wskazówki celu","en":"Goal cue words"},"why":{"pl":"Twoje słowa, po których aplikacja poznaje cel wiadomości (np. „napraw”, „wyjaśnij”) i dobiera do niego kontekst.","en":"Your words by which the app recognises a message's goal (e.g. “fix”, “explain”) and picks context for it."},"effect":{"pl":"Działa od następnego żądania; słowa wbudowane zostają.","en":"Applies from the next request; the builtin words stay."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"wybor","flows":["goal.typing"],"when_unset":{"pl":"wbudowane słowa sygnałowe","en":"the shipped cue words"}}},{"key":"catalog_semantic_candidates","scope":"config","group":"catalog","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Options of semantic candidate generation in the catalog.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Kandydaci semantyczni w katalogu","en":"Semantic candidates in the ca)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(talogue"},"why":{"pl":"Czy wyszukiwanie w katalogu plików projektu lub archiwum dobiera kandydatów także po podobieństwie znaczeń (wektorami) i jakim modelem.","en":"Whether a search of the project or archive file catalogue also picks candidates by similarity of meaning (vectors), and with which model."},"effect":{"pl":"Dotyczy następnego wyszukiwania w katalogu.","en":"Applies to the next catalogue search."},"levels":["person"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"analiza","flows":["catalog.scan"],"when_unset":{"pl":"własne opcje katalogu","en":"the catalogue's own options"}}},{"key":"usage_baseline_key_templates","scope":"config","group":"usage","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Templates of the baseline keys used by the usage policy.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Szablony kluczy odniesienia zużycia","en":"Usage baseline key templates"},"why":{"pl":"Jak nazywane są punkty odniesienia, z którymi Bezpiecznik ×10 porównuje nowe zużycie.","en":"How the baselines the ×10 fuse compares new consumption with are named."},"effect":{"pl":"Inne szablony = inne grupowanie historii zużycia; stare punkty nie są przepisywane.","en":"Other templates = another grouping of the usage history; old baselines are not rewritten."},"levels":["person"],"group":"koszty","subgroup":"ksiega","flows":["usage.spend","use_model"],"when_unset":{"pl":"wbudowane szablony kluczy","en":"the shipped key templates"}}},{"key":"usage_ledger_compaction","scope":"config","group":"usage","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Overrides of the usage ledger's compaction preset (runtime profile usage_compaction): mode off|manual|auto, older_than_days, statuses, fold_samples_beyond_window, reclaim_space, auto_interval_hours. Housekeeping of old completed operations, never a spending limit; pending, confirmed and denied operations are not folded.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Porządkowanie księgi zużycia","en":"Usage ledger compaction"},"why":{"pl":"Czy i kiedy stare wpisy zużycia są zwijane: wyłączone, ręcznie albo samo, po ilu dniach.","en":"Whether and when old usage entries are folded: off, by hand, or by itself after so many days."},"effect":{"pl":"Zwinięte wpisy zostają sumami; szczegóły z okna są zachowane.","en":"Folded entries remain as sums; the details within the window are kept."},"levels":["person"],"group":"koszty","subgroup":"ksiega","flows":["usage.compact"],"when_unset":{"pl":"profil porządkowania jak wbudowany","en":"the compaction profile as shipped"}}},{"key":"cleanup","scope":"config","group":"storage","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Housekeeping when the runtime starts (loom/cleanup.h); every value is a preset, none limits use. upload_part_max_age_hours (preset 24, 0 = keep forever): abandoned <data>/tmp/uploads/up_*.part files older than this are removed. orphan_blob_max_age_days (preset 0 = off): blobs older than this that no node, link, run, source, artifact or other database row and no top-level JSON file names by hash become candidates. orphan_blob_dry_run (preset true): candidates are only logged and reported; false deletes them. A blob that is named anywhere is never removed.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Porządki przy starcie","en":"Housekeeping at start"},"why":{"pl":"Co silnik sprząta przy uruchomieniu: porzucone części przesyłek, osierocone pliki (preset: tylko raport, nic nie kasuje).","en":"What the engine tidies at launch: abandoned upload parts, orphaned files (preset: report only, nothing is deleted)."},"effect":{"pl":"Plik, do którego cokolwiek się odwołuje, nigdy nie jest usuwany.","en":"A file that anything refers to is never removed."},"levels":["person"],"group":"prywatnosc","subgroup":"porzadki","flows":[],"when_unset":{"pl":"presety porządków (cleanup.h)","en":"the housekeeping presets (cleanup.h)"}}},{"key":"api_key","scope":"secret","group":"credentials","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Chat API key (OpenRouter); chat cannot run without it. Value is never returned.","sensitive":tru)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(e,"human":{"label":{"pl":"Klucz do usługi modeli","en":"Model service key"},"why":{"pl":"Klucz OpenRouter (lub Twojego dostawcy), bez którego czat nie działa; nigdy nie jest pokazywany ani wysyłany do modelu.","en":"The OpenRouter (or your provider's) key without which chat cannot run; never shown and never sent to a model."},"effect":{"pl":"Bez klucza każde wywołanie modelu kończy się czytelnym błędem (oprócz dostawcy lokalnego, który klucza nie potrzebuje); z kluczem rusza od razu.","en":"Without the key every model call ends with a plain error (except with the local provider, which needs no key); with it, calls run at once."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"dostawca","flows":["chat.send","semantic.analyse","agent.run","use_model","embedding.embed","batch.chat","goal.typing","analysis.run"]}},{"key":"anthropic_batch_key","scope":"secret","group":"credentials","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Anthropic Message Batches key for cheaper batch semantic analysis.","sensitive":true,"human":{"label":{"pl":"Klucz do analizy zbiorczej Anthropic","en":"Anthropic batch analysis key"},"why":{"pl":"Pozwala analizie w tle iść tańszym o połowę trybem zbiorczym, gdy czeka dużo wiadomości; bez klucza analiza idzie pojedynczo.","en":"Lets the background analysis use the half-price batch mode when many messages wait; without it the analysis runs one by one."},"effect":{"pl":"Z kluczem powyżej progu trybu zbiorczego wiadomości idą partiami (wolniej, taniej).","en":"With the key, above the batch threshold messages go in batches (slower, cheaper)."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"klucze","role":"analysis.fast","flows":["semantic.batch","use_model"],"technical_only":true}},{"key":"github_token","scope":"secret","group":"credentials","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"GitHub token for sync.","sensitive":true,"human":{"label":{"pl":"Token GitHub","en":"GitHub token"},"why":{"pl":"Pozwala synchronizować Twoje dane z repozytorium; nigdy nie jest pokazywany.","en":"Lets your data sync with the repository; never shown."},"effect":{"pl":"Bez tokena synchronizacja kończy się czytelnym błędem.","en":"Without the token a sync ends with a plain error."},"levels":["person"],"group":"prywatnosc","subgroup":"synchronizacja","flows":["github.sync"]}},{"key":"groq_api_key","scope":"secret","group":"credentials","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Groq key for speech recognition.","sensitive":true,"human":{"label":{"pl":"Klucz Groq (mowa → tekst)","en":"Groq key (speech to text)"},"why":{"pl":"Rozpoznawanie mowy przez Groq Whisper; bez klucza aplikacja próbuje Google.","en":"Speech recognition through Groq Whisper; without the key the app tries Google."},"effect":{"pl":"Nagranie głosu zamienia się w tekst przez Groq, gdy klucz jest ustawiony.","en":"A voice recording becomes text through Groq when the key is set."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"klucze","role":"asr","flows":["transcribe","use_model"],"technical_only":true}},{"key":"google_speech_api_key","scope":"secret","group":"credentials","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Google Speech key for speech recognition.","sensitive":true,"human":{"label":{"pl":"Klucz Google Speech (mowa → tekst)","en":"Google Speech key (speech to text)"},"why":{"pl":"Rozpoznawanie mowy przez Google, gdy Groq nie jest ustawiony albo zawiedzie.","en":"Speech recognition through Google when Groq is not set or fails."},"effect":{"pl":"Bez żadnego klucza mowy nagranie zostaje, ale nie zamienia się w tekst, z powodem.","en":"Without any speech key a recording stays but does not become text, with the reason."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"klucze","role":"asr","flows":["transcribe","use_model"],"technical_only":true}},{"key":"ocr_space_api_key","scope":"secret","group":"credentials","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"OCR.space key for screenshot OCR.","sensitive":true,"human":{"label":{"pl)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(":"Klucz OCR.space (tekst ze zdjęcia)","en":"OCR.space key (text from an image)"},"why":{"pl":"Czytanie tekstu ze zrzutów ekranu i zdjęć przy imporcie i w rozmowie.","en":"Reading text from screenshots and photos at import and in the chat."},"effect":{"pl":"Bez klucza zdjęcie zostaje załącznikiem bez tekstu, z powodem.","en":"Without the key a photo stays an attachment without text, with the reason."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"klucze","role":"ocr","flows":["ocr","import.file","use_model"],"technical_only":true}},{"key":"chat_context_order","scope":"config","group":"context","type":"string","has_default":false,"preset_from":{"profile":"chat_context","pointer":"/context_order"},"description":"Order of the context sections of a chat request, a name from the runtime profile chat_context (orders, with the user's profile overlay): stability (the profile's preset: system, profile, rules, memory, project, history, graph; the stable sections first so a provider's prompt cache hits; the profile and rules sections stay empty until the kernel fills them, work item M1-K1), legacy (system, memory, graph, project, history: the order before M1, the same request bytes), stable_first (system, memory, project, history, graph), or any order the user adds to profiles/chat_context.pack. The listed values are that profile's orders (values_from), so a write refuses only a name the effective profile does not know. Empty = the profile's context_order. A request may name its own order (option context_order). Default: none (the profile's preset).","values":[{"value":"","meaning":{"pl":"Puste: kolejność z ustawień domyślnych (preset).","en":"Empty: the order from the default settings (the preset)."}},{"value":"legacy","meaning":{"pl":"Klasycznie: instrukcja, pamięć, graf, projekt, historia (dawny preset; te same bajty żądania co przed zmianą).","en":"Classic: instruction, memory, graph, project, history (the former preset; the same request bytes as before the change)."}},{"value":"stable_first","meaning":{"pl":"Najpierw części stałe: instrukcja, pamięć, projekt, historia, graf.","en":"Stable parts first: instruction, memory, project, history, graph."}},{"value":"stability","meaning":{"pl":"Według stabilności (preset): instrukcja, profil, reguły, pamięć, projekt, historia, graf. Części „profil” i „reguły” są na razie puste — wypełni je jądro w pozycji K1.","en":"By stability (preset): instruction, profile, rules, memory, project, history, graph. The parts “profile” and “rules” are empty for now — the kernel fills them with work item K1."}}],"values_from":{"profile":"chat_context","pointer":"/orders","keys":true},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Kolejność części żądania","en":"Order of the request parts"},"why":{"pl":"W jakiej kolejności model dostaje instrukcję, profil, reguły, pamięć, projekt, historię i graf: według stabilności (preset: części stałe najpierw, żeby pamięć podręczna dostawcy trafiała częściej) albo klasycznie.","en":"In which order the model gets the instruction, profile, rules, memory, project, history and graph: by stability (preset: the stable parts first so the provider's prompt cache hits more often) or classically."},"effect":{"pl":"Ta sama treść w innej kolejności; gdy najpierw idą części stałe, powtarzające się żądania bywają tańsze. Puste = kolejność z pola „Kolejność części żądania (preset profilu)”.","en":"The same content in another order; with the stable parts first, repeated requests tend to be cheaper. Empty = the order of the field “Order of the request parts (profile preset)”."},"levels":["person","turn"],"group":"kontekst","subgroup":"wybor","flows":["chat.send"]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"language","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":false,"description":"Language of the notes the chat flow adds to a reply (an emergent element note, an invalid graph reply note): a language code with texts in the data (pl, en). Empty = en. The shell labels follow ui_language. Default: none (en).")LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(,"human":{"label":{"pl":"Język dopisków aplikacji","en":"Language of the app's notes"},"why":{"pl":"W jakim języku aplikacja dopisuje swoje uwagi w odpowiedziach (np. „element nieznany”, „odpowiedź w złym formacie”): pl albo en; pusty = en.","en":"In which language the app adds its own notes to replies (e.g. “unknown element”, “reply in the wrong format”): pl or en; empty = en."},"effect":{"pl":"Napisy menu mają własne pole (Język interfejsu); odpowiedzi modelu nie są tłumaczone.","en":"The menu labels have their own field (Interface language); model replies are not translated."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"wyglad","flows":["chat.send"],"when_unset":{"pl":"angielski","en":"English"}}},{"key":"model_capabilities","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"object","has_default":false,"description":"Your own capability overrides per model: {model id: {capability: value}}, layered over the adapter's and the provider manifest's capabilities when a request is checked (use_model, the agent loop, the context format). Nothing is substituted silently: a request a model cannot serve is rejected with the reason before anything is sent. Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Własne możliwości modeli","en":"Your own model capabilities"},"why":{"pl":"Co umie dany model (obrazy, narzędzia, format odpowiedzi…) według Ciebie, ponad to, co mówią adapter i manifest dostawcy.","en":"What a given model can do (images, tools, response format…) according to you, over what the adapter and the provider manifest say."},"effect":{"pl":"Żądanie, którego model według tych danych nie obsłuży, jest odrzucane z powodem, zanim cokolwiek zostanie wysłane.","en":"A request the model cannot serve according to these data is rejected with the reason before anything is sent."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"dostawca","flows":["use_model","chat.send","agent.run"],"when_unset":{"pl":"to, co mówią adapter i dostawca","en":"what the adapter and the provider say"}}},{"key":"provider_manifests","scope":"config","group":"chat","type":"array","has_default":false,"description":"Provider manifests you added, each in the ProviderManifest shape (id, adapter, base URL, capabilities, secret key name), loaded beside the builtin ones at call time so an edit applies to the next call; llm_provider, image_provider and speech_provider name a manifest by its id. Default: none.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Dodani dostawcy","en":"Added providers"},"why":{"pl":"Twoi dostawcy modeli obok wbudowanych: adres, adapter, możliwości i nazwa klucza; wskazujesz ich w polach dostawcy modeli, obrazów i mowy.","en":"Your model providers beside the builtin ones: address, adapter, capabilities and key name; the provider fields for models, images and speech name them."},"effect":{"pl":"Zmiana działa przy następnym wywołaniu modelu; wbudowani dostawcy zostają.","en":"A change applies to the next model call; the builtin providers stay."},"levels":["person"],"group":"modele","subgroup":"dostawca","flows":["use_model","chat.send","providers.list"],"when_unset":{"pl":"tylko wbudowani dostawcy","en":"only the built-in providers"}}},{"key":"navigator_layout","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"How the graph navigator draws a neighbourhood: both (preset: the list and the map together), list or map. One view model, two renderers; the path and the focus are the same whichever is drawn. Default: both.","values":[{"value":"both","meaning":{"pl":"Lista i mapa razem.","en":"List and map together."}},{"value":"list","meaning":{"pl":"Tylko lista (mapa zwinięta, jedno dotknięcie ją rozwija).","en":"List only (the map folded, one tap unfolds it)."}},{"value":"map","meaning":{"pl":"Tylko mapa (lista zwinięta, jedno dotknięcie ją rozwija).","en":"Map only (the list folded, one tap unfolds it)."}}],"status":{"state":"implemented","by":"M1-W0","reader":"web GraphNavigator","reason":{"pl":"Nawigator grafu (web GraphNavigator, M1-W0 P4) czyta to pol)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(e; wartość ma czytelnika i działa.","en":"The graph navigator (web GraphNavigator, M1-W0 P4) reads this field; the value has a reader and works."},"today":{"pl":"Nawigator grafu (menu ⋮ › Graf) czyta to pole przy otwarciu: both = lista i mapa rozwinięte, list = mapa zwinięta, map = lista zwinięta; zwiniętą część rozwiniesz jednym dotknięciem. Przycisk Widok ▾ na dolnym pasku zmienia wartość i zapisuje ją dla Ciebie.","en":"The graph navigator (menu ⋮ › Graf) reads this field when it opens: both = list and map unfolded, list = the map folded, map = the list folded; one tap unfolds a folded part. The Widok ▾ button on the bottom bar changes the value and saves it for you."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Układ nawigatora grafu","en":"Graph navigator layout"},"why":{"pl":"Czy graf pokazuje listę i mapę razem (preset), tylko listę, czy tylko mapę.","en":"Whether the graph shows the list and the map together (preset), the list only, or the map only."},"effect":{"pl":"Zmienia tylko rysunek; ten sam graf i ta sama ścieżka.","en":"Changes only the drawing; the same graph and the same path."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"nawigator","flows":[]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"perspective_composition","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"How several perspectives switched on at once are drawn on the map: sectors (preset: sectors of one map) or side_by_side (one map per perspective). Default: sectors.","values":[{"value":"sectors","meaning":{"pl":"Sektory jednej mapy.","en":"Sectors of one map."}},{"value":"side_by_side","meaning":{"pl":"Mapy obok siebie.","en":"Maps side by side."}}],"status":{"state":"planned","by":"M1-W0","reader":"web GraphNavigator (perspective sectors)","reason":{"pl":"Część aplikacji, która czyta to pole — sektory perspektyw w nawigatorze — jeszcze nie powstała; do tego czasu wartość jest zapisywana, ale nic jej nie czyta.","en":"The part of the app that reads this field — the perspective sectors of the navigator — is not built yet; until then the value is stored but nothing reads it."},"today":{"pl":"Dziś tej części ekranu jeszcze nie ma, więc wartość niczego nie zmienia.","en":"Today this part of the screen does not exist yet, so the value changes nothing."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Składanie perspektyw","en":"Composing perspectives"},"why":{"pl":"Gdy włączysz kilka perspektyw naraz: sektory jednej mapy (preset) albo mapy obok siebie.","en":"When several perspectives are on at once: sectors of one map (preset) or maps side by side."},"effect":{"pl":"Zmienia tylko rysunek mapy.","en":"Changes only the drawing of the map."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"nawigator","flows":[]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"navigator_children_limit","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"integer","has_default":true,"description":"How many children of one node graph.navigate returns per level when the request names no limit; the rest is collapsed and the navigator says how many (\"K nodes collapsed - change the budget\"). 0 = no limit. Default: 50.","human":{"label":{"pl":"Budżet węzłów na poziom","en":"Node budget per level"},"why":{"pl":"Ile dzieci jednego węzła nawigator pokazuje na raz; resztę zwija z napisem „zwinięto K węzłów — zmień budżet”. 0 = bez limitu.","en":"How many children of one node the navigator shows at once; the rest is collapsed with “K nodes collapsed — change the budget”. 0 = no limit."},"effect":{"pl":"Więcej = pełniejszy obraz, wolniejszy na telefonie; nic nie znika — zwinięte rozwijasz.","en":"More = a fuller picture, slower on a phone; nothing disappears — you expand what is collapsed."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"nawigator","flows":["graph.navigate"]}},{"key":"composer_context_strip","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"What the chat composer shows about what goes with the next message (selector profile, write level, model): chips (preset), hidden or full (a )LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(full description). Display only; the request is the same. Default: chips.","values":[{"value":"chips","meaning":{"pl":"Żetony nad polem pisania.","en":"Chips above the composer."}},{"value":"hidden","meaning":{"pl":"Nic.","en":"Nothing."}},{"value":"full","meaning":{"pl":"Pełny opis.","en":"A full description."}}],"status":{"state":"implemented","by":"M1-W1b","reader":"web ContextStrip","reason":{"pl":"Pasek kontekstu nad polem pisania (web ContextStrip, M1-W1b) czyta to pole; wartość ma czytelnika i działa.","en":"The context strip above the composer (web ContextStrip, M1-W1b) reads this field; the value has a reader and works."},"today":{"pl":"Pasek nad polem pisania czyta to pole przy otwarciu czatu: chips = żetony „Profil: …” i, gdy to okno wie o zmianie na następne zapytanie, „Następne zapytanie: szerzej”; full = ten sam opis zdaniami; hidden = nic. Pasek zna tylko zmiany zrobione w tym oknie (silnik nie ma odczytu tego, co czeka na następne zapytanie). Model pokazuje chip modelu, nie pasek.","en":"The strip above the composer reads this field when the chat opens: chips = the chips “Profile: …” and, when this window knows of a change for the next request, “Next request: wider”; full = the same said in sentences; hidden = nothing. The strip knows only the changes made in this window (the engine cannot read what waits for the next request). The model is shown by the model chip, not by the strip."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Pasek kontekstu nad polem pisania","en":"Context strip above the composer"},"why":{"pl":"Czy nad polem pisania widać, co idzie z wiadomością (profil, zakres, model): żetony (preset), nic albo pełny opis.","en":"Whether what goes with a message (profile, scope, model) shows above the composer: chips (preset), nothing, or a full description."},"effect":{"pl":"Zmienia tylko, co widać; to, co idzie z wiadomością, zostaje takie samo.","en":"Changes only what is shown; what goes with the message stays the same."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"czat","flows":[]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"receipt_link","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"Where the \"What we sent\" link of a reply is shown: visible (preset: under the reply) or menu_only (in the message menu only). The receipt itself is governed by context_receipt_store. Default: visible.","values":[{"value":"visible","meaning":{"pl":"Pod odpowiedzią.","en":"Under the reply."}},{"value":"menu_only","meaning":{"pl":"Tylko w menu wiadomości.","en":"In the message menu only."}}],"status":{"state":"implemented","by":"M1-W1a","reader":"web receipt line under a reply","reason":{"pl":"Linia pod odpowiedzią (web ChatView, M1-W1a) czyta to pole; wartość ma czytelnika i działa.","en":"The line under a reply (web ChatView, M1-W1a) reads this field; the value has a reader and works."},"today":{"pl":"Przy odpowiedzi asystenta w czacie: visible = linia „Kontekst: … — zobacz” otwiera arkusz „Co wysłaliśmy”; menu_only = linii nie ma, arkusz otwiera pozycja „Co wysłaliśmy” w menu wiadomości.","en":"Under an assistant reply in the chat: visible = the line “Context: … — see” opens the sheet “What we sent”; menu_only = no line, the entry “What we sent” of the message menu opens the sheet."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Odnośnik „Co wysłaliśmy”","en":"The “What we sent” link"},"why":{"pl":"Czy pod odpowiedzią widać odnośnik do śladu tego, co poszło do modelu (preset), czy tylko w menu wiadomości.","en":"Whether the link to the trail of what went to the model shows under a reply (preset) or only in the message menu."},"effect":{"pl":"Ślad zapisuje się niezależnie od tego pola (patrz Zapis śladu „Co wysłaliśmy”).","en":"The trail is stored regardless of this field (see Storing the “What we sent” trail)."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"czat","flows":[]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"topbar_model_line","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"How the top bar of t)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(he chat shows the conversation model: chip (preset: a chip beside the title) or second_line (a separate second line). Default: chip.","values":[{"value":"chip","meaning":{"pl":"Żeton obok tytułu.","en":"A chip beside the title."}},{"value":"second_line","meaning":{"pl":"Osobna druga linia.","en":"A separate second line."}}],"status":{"state":"planned","by":"M1-W0","reader":"web top bar model chip","reason":{"pl":"Część aplikacji, która czyta to pole — chip modelu w górnym pasku — jeszcze nie powstała; do tego czasu wartość jest zapisywana, ale nic jej nie czyta.","en":"The part of the app that reads this field — the model chip of the top bar — is not built yet; until then the value is stored but nothing reads it."},"today":{"pl":"Dziś tej części ekranu jeszcze nie ma, więc wartość niczego nie zmienia.","en":"Today this part of the screen does not exist yet, so the value changes nothing."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Model na górnym pasku","en":"Model on the top bar"},"why":{"pl":"Jak pokazać model rozmowy u góry ekranu: żeton obok tytułu (preset) albo osobna druga linia.","en":"How to show the conversation model at the top of the screen: a chip beside the title (preset) or a separate second line."},"effect":{"pl":"Zmienia tylko wygląd paska.","en":"Changes only the look of the bar."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"czat","flows":[]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"onboarding_card","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"Whether the profile interview card is shown in the conversation window: show (preset), later (hidden until the next launch) or never. Never does not delete the profile; the interview can always be started with a command (profile.interview). Default: show.","values":[{"value":"show","meaning":{"pl":"Pokazuj.","en":"Show."}},{"value":"later","meaning":{"pl":"Później (do następnego uruchomienia).","en":"Later (until the next launch)."}},{"value":"never","meaning":{"pl":"Nigdy.","en":"Never."}}],"status":{"state":"implemented","by":"M1-W2a","reader":"web empty-chat onboarding card","reason":{"pl":"Karta „Poznajmy się” w pustym czacie (web ChatView, M1-W2a) czyta to pole; wartość ma czytelnika i działa.","en":"The “Let us get to know each other” card of the empty chat (web ChatView, M1-W2a) reads this field; the value has a reader and works."},"today":{"pl":"Pusty czat pokazuje kartę „Poznajmy się”, gdy to pole ma wartość show, a wywiad jeszcze się nie zaczął. Przycisk Później zapisuje later: karta znika do następnego uruchomienia aplikacji, wtedy aplikacja przy starcie wraca do show. Przycisk Nigdy nie pytaj zapisuje never: karta nie wraca, dopóki nie zmienisz tej wartości tutaj. Wywiad można zacząć też poleceniem w rozmowie.","en":"The empty chat shows the card “Let us get to know each other” when this field is show and the interview has not started. The Later button saves later: the card disappears until the app is launched next time, and at that start the app sets it back to show. The Never ask button saves never: the card does not return until you change this value here. The interview can also be started with a command in a conversation."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Karta pierwszych kroków","en":"First-steps card"},"why":{"pl":"Czy w okienku rozmowy pokazuje się karta wywiadu o Tobie: tak (preset), później albo nigdy.","en":"Whether the card of the interview about you shows in the conversation window: yes (preset), later, or never."},"effect":{"pl":"„Nigdy” nie kasuje profilu; wywiad zawsze można zacząć poleceniem.","en":"“Never” does not delete the profile; the interview can always be started with a command."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"wyglad","flows":[]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"android_back_exit_confirm","scope":"config","group":"ui","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"What the system back button does on the first screen of the Android shell: ask (preset: a confirmation before leaving), never (back never lea)LPROFILE",
  R"LPROFILE(ves the app) or always (leaves without asking). No effect in a browser. Default: ask.","values":[{"value":"ask","meaning":{"pl":"Pyta przed wyjściem.","en":"Asks before leaving."}},{"value":"never","meaning":{"pl":"Nigdy nie wychodzi.","en":"Never leaves."}},{"value":"always","meaning":{"pl":"Wychodzi bez pytania.","en":"Leaves without asking."}}],"status":{"state":"planned","by":"M1-A0","reader":"Android shell MainActivity (OnBackPressedDispatcher <-> __loomBack/goBack)","reason":{"pl":"Część aplikacji, która czyta to pole — obsługa przycisku wstecz na Androidzie — jeszcze nie powstała; do tego czasu wartość jest zapisywana, ale nic jej nie czyta.","en":"The part of the app that reads this field — the Android back button handling — is not built yet; until then the value is stored but nothing reads it."},"today":{"pl":"Dziś przycisk wstecz na Androidzie od razu zamyka aplikację, bez pytania i bez cofania się w niej.","en":"Today the Android back button closes the app at once, without asking and without stepping back inside it."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Wstecz na Androidzie wychodzi z aplikacji","en":"Android back leaves the app"},"why":{"pl":"Co robi systemowe „wstecz” na pierwszym ekranie: pyta (preset), wychodzi bez pytania albo nigdy nie wychodzi.","en":"What the system back does on the first screen: asks (preset), leaves without asking, or never leaves."},"effect":{"pl":"Dotyczy tylko powłoki Androida; w przeglądarce nie ma wpływu.","en":"Applies to the Android shell only; no effect in a browser."},"levels":["person"],"group":"interfejs","subgroup":"nawigacja","flows":[]},"on_unlisted":"refuse"},{"key":"secrets_in_chat","scope":"config","group":"safety","type":"string","has_default":true,"description":"What happens to a credential (API key, token, password) typed into the conversation: never (preset: it is neither stored in the history nor sent to the model provider, the reply points to Settings; the model does not need your keys), ask (a confirmation each time) or allow (the sentence goes through as typed, with exactly the request bytes of an ordinary message). A setting, not a rule: you may change it. Default: never.","values":[{"value":"never","meaning":{"pl":"Nigdy nie zapisuj ani nie wysyłaj; model nie potrzebuje Twoich kluczy.","en":"Never store or send; the model does not need your keys."}},{"value":"ask","meaning":{"pl":"Pytaj za każdym razem.","en":"Ask every time."}},{"value":"allow","meaning":{"pl":"Przepuszczaj jak każdą wiadomość.","en":"Let through like any message."}}],"status":{"state":"planned","by":"M1-K1","reader":"kernel chat.send and input.route_intent secret filter","reason":{"pl":"Część aplikacji, która czyta to pole — filtr kluczy i haseł w wiadomościach i poleceniach — jeszcze nie powstała; do tego czasu wartość jest zapisywana, ale nic jej nie czyta.","en":"The part of the app that reads this field — the key-and-password filter of messages and commands — is not built yet; until then the value is stored but nothing reads it."},"today":{"pl":"Dziś klucz lub hasło wpisane w rozmowie jest zapisywane w historii i wysyłane dostawcy modelu jak każda wiadomość.","en":"Today a key or password typed in a conversation is stored in the history and sent to the model provider like any message."}},"human":{"label":{"pl":"Klucze i hasła w rozmowie","en":"Keys and passwords in the chat"},"why":{"pl":"Co robić z kluczem lub hasłem wpisanym w rozmowie: nigdy nie zapisywać ani nie wysyłać (preset — model nie potrzebuje Twoich kluczy; ustawiasz je w Ustawieniach), pytać za każdym razem albo przepuszczać.","en":"What to do with a key or password typed into the chat: never store or send it (preset — the model does not need your keys; you set them in Settings), ask every time, or let it through."},"effect":{"pl":"„Przepuszczaj” zapisuje wpis w historii i wysyła go dostawcy modelu jak każdą wiadomość.","en":"“Let through” stores the entry in the history and sends it to the model provider like any message."},